An unclosed fence under a multi-line quote paragraph in a container opens nothing

````
::: note
> para
> more
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <blockquote><p>para
more</p></blockquote>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

````
::: note
> a
> b
> c
> d
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <blockquote><p>a
b
c
d</p></blockquote>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````
